WEBVTT

NOTE storyboard documented-vs-observed: 5 steps and 2 cards

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.548
Seen on the wire, missing from the record

2
00:00:02.548 --> 00:00:08.773
One site's topology: the documented links in solid lines, and dashed, links only seen on the wire.

3
00:00:08.773 --> 00:00:15.039
The review queue lists the links seen on the wire that the record lacks.

4
00:00:15.039 --> 00:00:22.295
Open the first: the map marks that ghost link, beside the documented ones.

5
00:00:22.295 --> 00:00:30.237
A second and a third, in other parts of the network: neighbours the switches report over LLDP or CDP.

6
00:00:30.237 --> 00:00:36.420
Next, the reviewer documents each link, or dismisses it.

7
00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:38.960
Documented and observed, on one topology.
